{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "AMO",
  "chapter": 5,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hear ye this word which I take up against you, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a lamentation, O house of Israel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The virgin of Israel is fallen; she shall no more rise! she is forsaken upon her land; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " none to raise her up.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For thus saith the Lord GOD; The city that went out ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "by",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a thousand shall leave a hundred, and that which went forth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "by",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a hundred shall leave ten, to the house of Israel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For thus saith the LORD to the house of Israel, Seek ye me, and ye shall live:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But seek not Beth-el, nor enter into Gilgal, and pass not to Beer-sheba: for Gilgal shall surely go into captivity, and Beth-el shall come to naught.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Seek the LORD, and ye shall live; lest he break out like fire in the house of Joseph, and devour ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " none to quench ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in Beth-el.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ye who turn judgment to wormwood, and leave off righteousness on the earth,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Seek him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " that maketh the seven stars and Orion, and turneth the shades of death into the morning, and maketh the day dark with night: that calleth for the waters of the sea, and poureth them out upon the face of the earth: JEHOVAH ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his name:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That strengtheneth the spoiled against the strong, so that the spoiled shall come against the fortress.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They hate him that rebuketh in the gate, and they abhor him that speaketh uprightly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Forasmuch therefore as your treading ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon the poor, and ye take from him burdens of wheat: ye have built houses of hewn stone, but ye shall not dwell in them; ye have planted pleasant vineyards, but ye shall not drink wine of them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I know your manifold transgressions and your mighty sins: they afflict the just, they take a bribe, and they turn aside the poor in the gate ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "from their right",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore the prudent shall keep silence in that time; for it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " an evil time.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Seek good, and not evil, that ye may live: and so the LORD, the God of hosts, shall be with you, as ye have spoken.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hate the evil, and love the good, and establish judgment in the gate: it may be that the LORD God of hosts will be gracious to the remnant of Joseph.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore the LORD, the God of hosts, the Lord, saith thus; Wailing ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in all streets; and they shall say in all the highways, Alas! alas! and they shall call the husbandman to mourning, and such as are skillful in lamentation to wailing.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And in all vineyards ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " wailing: for I will pass through thee, saith the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Woe to you that desire the day of the LORD! to what end ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " it for you? the day of the LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " darkness, and not light.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As if a man fled from a lion, and a bear met him; or went into the house, and leaned his hand on the wall, and a serpent bit him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Shall",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not the day of the LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " darkness, and not light? even very dark, and no brightness in it?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I hate, I despise your feast days, and I will not smell in your solemn assemblies.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Though ye offer me burnt-offerings and your meat-offerings, I will not accept ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "; neither will I regard the peace-offerings of your fat beasts.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Take thou away from me the noise of thy songs; for I will not hear the melody of thy viols.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But let judgment run down as waters, and righteousness as a mighty stream.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Have ye offered to me sacrifices and offerings in the wilderness forty years, O house of Israel?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But ye have borne the tabernacle of your Moloch and Chiun your images, the star of your god, which ye made to yourselves.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.5.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.5.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore I will cause you to go into captivity beyond Damascus, saith the LORD, whose name ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " The God of hosts.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
